w: Oh I | went down South for to | see my Sal, sing | Pol-ly wol-ly doo-dle all the | day. My _ | Sal, she is a | spun-ky gal, sing | Pol-ly wol-ly doo-dle all the | day. Fare thee | well, fare thee | well, fare thee | well, my fair-y | fay, For I'm | go-ing to Lou-i-si-an-a | for to see my Su-sy-an-na, | Pol-ly wol-ly doo-dle all the | day.
